<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.invite.hands ~ invite ~ one invite out of the wallet

`lares walk invite` hands the newest invite out of the wallet as one string to carry to one newcomer; it redeems once, at the hearth's own gate. The answer names how many stay in the wallet.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ hand

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`hand` params=`~ print the newest invite`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ none

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ custody

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`custody` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ one sealed act frame on the custody door under the vessel key; the walk record never rests in the clear`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ refused · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the custody door refused the act; the message names why`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the act failed outside the door's refusals`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ handed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`handed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[gatePubKey invite left via]] ~ the invite string and what stays in the wallet`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares walk invite

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares walk invite]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

